---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service – Background Changer"
  description="Terms and conditions for utilizing the free Background Changer online photo utility."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        1. Free Utility Usage
      </h2>
      <p>
        Background Changer (onlinebackgroundchange.com) is provided as a free online client-side utility tool for editing photo backgrounds, cropping images, and formatting portraits for job applications, identification cards, and documentation.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        2. Official Document Compliance Disclaimer
      </h2>
      <p>
        While preset aspect ratios and standard dimensions (such as 2×2 inch or 3:4) are provided to assist you, official photo requirements differ across government passport offices, visa consular departments, and academic institutions. Users are solely responsible for ensuring that photos comply with their relevant authority's official guidelines before submission.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        3. Disclaimer of Warranties
      </h2>
      <p>
        This software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied. Under no circumstances shall the creators be liable for any damages arising out of the use or inability to use this service.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
